findings.proposal:
On the browser branch, skip renderNow() while the gate is up:
- fill #view with the ocean colour (one fillRect);
- call updateReadout, updateLegend and updateScaleBar if the status bar must not be empty;
- render the empty world only on 'Skip for now' (_setupHide with no world). Generate, Load and Import render anyway.
Optionally, defer GPU.init to the first generate.

Expected gain (estimate): the load long task drops from about 2.1-2.3 s to about 0.3 s, and time to interactive from about 2.5-2.8 s to about 0.6-0.8 s.
